🔗 Connecting Issues to Quality Dimensions

This is where you should be able to think like a data analyst.

Problem	Quality dimension affected
Missing age	Completeness
Wrong age	Accuracy
Kenya, KENYA, kenya	Consistency
Age = -5	Validity
